            <ArticleTitle>[Peridural morphine for postoperative analgesia in patients following Milligan-Morgan surgery].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>35-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Postoperative analgesia and side effects of epidural morphine (3 mg in 5 ml saline) were studied in 30 patients scheduled for Milligan-Morgan surgery. The patients were pain-free for a mean duration of 10-12 hr. Urinary retention was the most prominent side effect observed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
